---
description: ethskills knowledge pack and project rules for DigiPaga Robotics
alwaysApply: true
---

Before writing Solidity, deploying contracts, integrating DeFi, or building a dApp frontend, read https://ethskills.com/SKILL.md and follow it.

Project Stack:
- Foundry, Rust/Stylus, Next.js, Viem, ZeroDev.
- Chains: Arbitrum Sepolia, Robinhood Chain Testnet.
- Key Standards: ERC-8004, x402 payments.

Never hallucinate addresses or outdated gas patterns. Prioritize security, proper testing (Foundry fuzz/invariant), and clean frontend UX (loading states, proper wallet flows).
